        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience understands the concept of systemic fragility and collective endurance.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Resilience in democratic systems emerges from continuous engagement, not singular events.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There is shared value in preserving democracy among the listener group.",
        "confidence": 0.87
